179
00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:29.720
if the somebody you want to become important to is the Lord, then you will become great.

180
00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:34.920
But if you want to become an important somebody in your own right, you're going to give yourself

181
00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:42.200
terrible trouble on this earth. So this business, as soon as we acquire human reason, we say,

182
00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:47.400
I am something or I am important. And this is the beginning of pride, which is independence

183
00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:51.840
of God. And of course, the world tells you to lean on yourself and sell yourself and

184
00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:58.540
all the rest of it. And believing themselves to be something, they move away from me, Jesus

185
00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:05.360
said, they don't trust me who am the all. And they draw all their confidence and strength

186
00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:11.960
from themselves. So I want to give you Proverbs three verses five to nine, which tells you

187
00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:18.360
my son, lean not on your own understanding, lean upon the greatness of God and the wisdom

188
00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:26.040
of God. And this is the mistake that the world continuously makes. From this, it happens that

189
00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:32.840
they even lose every good beginning. And by losing the good beginning, what will the end

190
00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:40.440
be? In other words, if they go wrong at a very early age, then their lives could go

191
00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:48.460
very seriously, criminally wrong. We know that if you plant a tree or a shrub and something

192
00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.680
goes wrong in the very early stages, you're not looking forward to a great shrub or a

193
00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:59.240
great tree, you're going to look forward to trouble. Imagine yourself, my daughter, Jesus

194
00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:09.520
says, moreover, by moving away from me, who contains every good, what good can man hope

195
00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:16.360
for since he is a sea of evil. Now, this is the Lord speaking, this isn't me, I'm reading

196
00:23:16.360 --> 00:23:24.980
